// endpoint_arrange_sidebar.proto — ArrangeSidebar: change how the repository
// grouping is ARRANGED. SIDEBAR section.
//
// THE ARRANGEMENT IS THE TAB BAR'S ORDER. The repository grouping draws its
// repositories in their stored order; inside each repository, ONE ORDER OF
// ENTRIES (frontend.v1.RosterRepoSection.entries): the workspaces in no
// subsection and the subsections, interleaved as arranged, so a subsection
// may stand between two unsectioned workspaces, each subsection with its own
// workspaces below its header. The Emacs tab bar walks the open workspaces
// in exactly that order (frontend.v1.RosterOpenRow.tab): every workspace of
// an earlier repository before any of a later one, and inside a repository,
